  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the robata grill to medium high heat.",
    "In a large bowl, toss the veal pieces with smoked paprika, garlic, sea salt, and black pepper.",
    "Add the olive oil to the preheated grill and swirl to coat.",
    "Add the veal to the grill and cook for 5 minutes per side, or until browned.",
    "Add the onion, carrots, and celery to the grill and cook until the vegetables are tender.",
    "Add the chickpeas to the grill and stir to combine with the veal and vegetables.",
    "Cook for an additional 2 minutes, or until the chickpeas are heated through.",
    "Serve the veal and chickpea mixture hot, garnished with chopped fresh parsley if desired."
  ],
